There are ascension posts by folks who do all of the mines before
any of sokoban and vice versa, so there's no real right answer for
whjich strategy to pick.  With my alternation one I spend a fair
amount of time shuttling between levels.  I'm also often healing
back to max HP and energy during those walks.

The mines are more densely filled with monsters so they are more
dangerous than regular levels, but they also give a lot of armor
and weapon items.  This makes them very worth exploring but
very tempting to explore too fast.  My alternation strategy attempts
to address that but doesn't do all that great a job of it.



